<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Happy Birthday Gunnu ❤️</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0308;
            --card-bg: rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.08);
            --neon-pink: #ff2a5f;
            --accent-purple: #9a4dff;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: #fff;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 420px;
            background: rgba(18, 7, 15, 0.95);
            border: 2px solid var(--neon-pink);
            box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.4);
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            text-align: center;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 20px 0;
            animation: fadeIn 0.8s ease-in-out;
        }

        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            color: var(--neon-pink);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.5);
        }

        input {
            width: 80%;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border: 1px solid var(--neon-pink);
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 15px 0;
            outline: none;
        }

        button {
            padding: 12px 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--accent-purple));
            border: none;
            color: white;
            font-size: 1rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.5);
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        button:active {
            transform: scale(0.95);
        }

        .gallery {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }

        .photo-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.3);
            border-radius: 18px;
            padding: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        .photo-card img {
            width: 100%;
            border-radius: 12px;
            display: block;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .photo-card p {
            margin: 10px 0 5px 0;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #ffd1dc;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }

        .letter {
            text-align: left;
            background: rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.05);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--neon-pink);
            margin: 20px 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div id="lockscreen" class="container">
        <h2>Hey Gunnu! ✨</h2>
        <p style="color: #ccc;">A special surprise is waiting for you...<br>Enter your secret passcode below!</p>
        <input type="password" id="passInput" placeholder="Passcode">
        <br>
        <button onclick="unlock()">UNLOCK 🔒</button>
    </div>

    <div id="mainscreen" class="container" style="display: none;">
        <h2>Happy Birthday, Gunnu! 🎉❤️</h2>
        <p style="color: #ffb3c6; font-size: 0.9rem;">The most beautiful girl in the world!</p>

        <div class="letter">
            <p>Pata hai Gunnu, tum mere liye kitni special ho? Tum sirf meri best friend nahi ho, tum meri poori duniya ho!</p>
            <p>Tumhara bubbly nature, tumhari smile, aur jab main chup baithta hoon toh tumhara mujhe tease karna... ye sab meri life ke sabse best moments hain.</p>
            <p>Hum dono ka gussa, hamari baatein, aur yahan tak ki hum dono ka chashma aur eye-power tak same hai! 😉 Always stay happy because tumhari khushi hi meri khushi hai! 💕</p>
        </div>

        <h3>Our Sweet Memories 📸</h3>

        <div class="gallery">
            <div class="photo-card">
                <img src="1000005509.jpg" alt="Memory 1">
                <p>Always smiling & bubbly Gunnu! ✨</p>
            </div>

            <div class="photo-card">
                <img src="1000005510.jpg" alt="Memory 2">
                <p>The cutest person ever ❤️</p>
            </div>

            <div class="photo-card">
                <img src="1000005511.jpg" alt="Memory 3">
                <p>Unforgettable moments together 💫</p>
            </div>

            <div class="photo-card">
                <img src="1000005513.png" alt="Memory 4">
                <p>My best friend forever 👭</p>
            </div>

            <div class="photo-card">
                <img src="1000005514.jpg" alt="Memory 5">
                <p>Stay bright & beautiful always! 💖</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function unlock() {
            var input = document.getElementById("passInput").value;
            // Password set to 2508
            if(input === "2508") {
                document.getElementById("lockscreen").style.display = "none";
                document.getElementById("mainscreen").style.display = "block";
                window.scrollTo(0, 0); // Scroll to top when unlocked
            } else {
                alert("Oops! Wrong password bestie. Try again! 😉");
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
